WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.102
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: PowerPoint: Animation and Presenting.

2
00:00:06.402 --> 00:00:11.156
Add movement and present your slides. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:15.545
Step one. Click the text or picture you want to animate.

4
00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:24.395
Step two. Open the Animations tab and choose Fade. Use only one simple style, so your audience can focus on your message.

5
00:00:25.383 --> 00:00:31.138
Step three. Click Slide Show, then From Beginning. You can also press F five.

6
00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:40.288
Step four. Click or press the right arrow to go to the next slide. Press Escape to stop. Speak clearly, and look at your audience.

7
00:00:41.283 --> 00:00:46.014
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:46.314 --> 00:00:48.731
Add a Fade animation to one slide.

9
00:00:49.031 --> 00:00:51.298
Present from the beginning with F5.

10
00:00:51.598 --> 00:00:54.608
Practise your talk and time it: 2 minutes.

11
00:00:54.908 --> 00:00:55.932
Well done!

